1
00:00:11,832 --> 00:00:14,972
Bonjour, Adrien !
Hello, Adrien!

2
00:00:15,072 --> 00:00:19,916
Bonjour, Marinette ! Ça va ?
Hello, Marinette! How are you?

3
00:00:20,016 --> 00:00:25,004
Ça va bien, merci. Et toi ?
I'm fine, thank you. And you?

4
00:00:25,104 --> 00:00:28,940
Très bien ! J'ai faim.
Very well! I'm hungry.

5
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:34,004
Moi aussi. Allons à la boulangerie !
Me too. Let's go to the bakery!

6
00:00:34,104 --> 00:00:36,476
Bonne idée !
Good idea!

7
00:00:36,576 --> 00:00:43,244
Bonjour, madame. Je voudrais un croissant, s'il vous plaît.
Hello, madam. I would like a croissant, please.

8
00:00:43,344 --> 00:00:47,660
Et pour moi, une baguette, s'il vous plaît.
And for me, a baguette, please.

9
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:50,516
Ça coûte combien ?
How much is it?

10
00:00:50,616 --> 00:00:53,588
Trois euros cinquante.
Three euros fifty.

11
00:00:53,688 --> 00:00:56,060
Voilà !
Here you go!

12
00:00:56,160 --> 00:01:01,100
Merci, madame. Au revoir !
Thank you, madam. Goodbye!

13
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:04,604
Mmm, il est délicieux !
Mmm, it's delicious!

14
00:01:04,704 --> 00:01:07,964
À demain, Marinette !
See you tomorrow, Marinette!
